# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# backend/.env.example
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to backend/.env and fill in real values.
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#
# backend/.env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Supabase (REQUIRED) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# App will refuse to start if either of these is missing (see main.py lifespan).
# Find these in: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-or-anon-key

# ── Ollama (OPTIONAL) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only uncomment/set these if you need something other than the defaults
# baked into app/services/ai_service.py.

# Host where the local Ollama server is running.
# Default: http://127.0.0.1:11434
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# Embedding model — MUST stay 768-dimensional to match the Supabase
# pgvector(768) column, unless you also migrate the DB schema.
# Default: nomic-embed-text
# OLLAMA_EMBEDDING_MODEL=nomic-embed-text

# Chat/summarisation model.
# Default in code: llama3.1 — but llama3.2:3b is recommended on machines
# with limited RAM (avoids the ggml CPU_REPACK buffer allocation failure).
# OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL=llama3.2:3b
